  "prompt": "/deep-research Of the founding members of the Organisation of Eastern Caribbean States with a population growth rate of less than 0.5% in 2021 (according to the CIA world factbook 2021 archive), did any have an under 5 mortality rate of less than 20 per 1000 live births in 2020 (according to UN data) and also a female life expectancy at birth of over 75 years in 2020 (according to UN data)? If so please list them.",
  "prompt_prefix": "/deep-research ",
  "instruction": "Of the founding members of the Organisation of Eastern Caribbean States with a population growth rate of less than 0.5% in 2021 (according to the CIA world factbook 2021 archive), did any have an under 5 mortality rate of less than 20 per 1000 live births in 2020 (according to UN data) and also a female life expectancy at birth of over 75 years in 2020 (according to UN data)? If so please list them.",
  "answer": "**Answer: Only Grenada meets all three criteria.**\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n| Country | 2021 Pop Growth (CIA 2021 Archive) | 2020 U5MR (UN IGME) | 2020 Female LE (UN WPP) | All Three? |\n|---------|-----------------------------------|---------------------|------------------------|------------|\n| Grenada | **0.35%** ✅ | **16.40** ✅ | **78.21** ✅ | **YES** |\n\nAll other OECS founding members fail at least one criterion:\n- **Antigua & Barbuda**: Pop growth 1.17% (fails)\n- **Dominica**: U5MR 35.40 (fails), Female LE 74.59 (fails)\n- **Montserrat**: Pop growth 0.52% (fails)\n- **St. Kitts & Nevis**: Pop growth 0.64% (fails)\n- **St. Lucia**: U5MR 24.40 (fails)\n- **St. Vincent & Grenadines**: Female LE 74.46 (fails)\n\n---\n\n### Sources\n\n1. **Population Growth (CIA World Factbook 2021 Archive - Grenada)**: https://worldfactbookarchive.org/archive/2021/GD\n2. **Under-5 Mortality Rate (UN IGME 2020 - Grenada)**: https://www.indexmundi.com/facts/grenada/indicator/SH.DYN.MORT\n3. **Female Life Expectancy (UN World Population Prospects 2020 - Grenada)**: https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/womens-life-expectancy-at-birth\n\n---\n\n### Notes\n- The CIA World Factbook 2021 archive was accessed via worldfactbookarchive.org for all 7 founding members\n- Under-5 mortality comes from UN Inter-agency Group for Child Mortality Estimation (UN IGME) as cited by IndexMundi/childmortality.org\n- Female life expectancy comes from UN World Population Prospects (2024 revision, containing 2020 historical estimates) via Our World in Data",
  "answer_chars": 1519,
  "expected_answer": "Grenada, Saint Lucia",
